33399.a:
```hcl
variable "ingress_ports" { default = [80, 443] }

resource "aws_security_group" "web" {
  name   = "web"
  vpc_id = var.vpc_id

  dynamic "ingress" {
    for_each = var.ingress_ports
    content {
      from_port   = ingress.value
      to_port     = ingress.value
      protocol    = "tcp"
      cidr_blocks = ["0.0.0.0/0"]
    }
  }
}
```
Iterator nomi default blok nomi (`ingress.value`, `ingress.key`).
Ko'p hollarda alohida resurs (`aws_vpc_security_group_ingress_rule` + `for_each`) aniqroq: har qoida alohida manzilga ega, o'zgarish boshqalariga tegmaydi.

33400.a:
```hcl
resource "terraform_data" "migrate" {
  triggers_replace = [var.app_version]        # versiya o'zgarsa qayta ishlaydi
  provisioner "local-exec" {
    command = "./scripts/migrate.sh ${var.app_version}"
  }
}
```
- `terraform_data` (1.4+) — `null_resource`ning o'rnini bosadi, provider kerak emas.
- `remote-exec` SSH ulanish, kalit va tarmoq kirishini talab qiladi — CI'da mo'rt.
- Imkon qadar: `user_data` (birinchi boot), Packer bilan tayyor AMI, konfiguratsiya uchun Ansible.
